              "lines": [
                "Bwana kanena watu wangu wanateswa, Musa ukawatoe huko misri ¨Wanenda katika muji (muji) ni liowahidia inchi iyo ya furaha ya jehova ¨2x Musa, Musa, Musa tuna tabika tupe maji ya kunywa tazama shindo la Farao, jazareni wajoli tupo ndani ya kibofu tupo ndani ya baba aleluya na yeye ndani mwetu."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-cda068ef",
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Yoyoyo buatafunae kunde ni miongoni mwetu¨2x"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-5425ebd5",
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "- Ukijesabia kuwa mu kisto, bulevi nabo aujaacha, ila unadanganya watu ni kumucha mungu.",
                "- Ukijesabia kuwa mwaminifu, bulozi nabo aujaacha"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-a6379a3d",
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "ila unadanganya watu ni kumucha mungu. (yoyoyo) buatafunae kunde ni miongoni mwetu."
              ]
            }
          ],
