              "lines": [
                "Mungu wa Musa utukaribie leo , ewe mungu wa baba sisi tumesongwa sana \" Farao na majeshi yake wametusonga vikali \"2x"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-b0d791d5",
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "**_Ref : Kweli kweli ewe Musa wa baba , tumesongwa sana bahari ni mbele yetu ._**",
                "**_Com : Watoto wangu wamekufa mu jangwa_**",
                "**_Tafazali tunge baki mu misri_**",
                "**_Tafazali tunge kufa mu misri_**"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-823df645",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "2",
              "lines": [
                "Musa muzazi akapata uchungu akaenda kuomba , kuomba mungu baba akapinga magoti kuomba mungu baba."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-e5bfd4d9",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "3",
              "lines": [
                "Mungu naye akamujibu musa , \" Upige bakora mu maji wote wa vuke inhi kavu \"2x Israeli wakapita wote Farao wakakufa wote wana watukuze bwana ."
              ]
            }
