              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Mutu mwengine alikuwa Musa muteule kwa kwanza wana isrzeli njiani, mufalme akawapa hekima akawafanyia mema akafurahisha wajoli aliokuwa nao hawali."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-fa5b80db",
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Kuku vifaranga usiviache jehova mungu wasije kushikwa wana kuko nyama."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-1644bf55",
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "- Eh mungu: wasije kushikwa wana kuko nyama",
                "- Vifaranga wako Hakida mufalme yesu twende mbele (twende mbele) na wana wachanga mungu awenasi daima, daima mungu awenasi, daima, daima milele."
