              "type": "verse",
              "number": "1",
              "lines": [
                "Eh ee wajoli mimi ndimi mukristu uzima huu ni nao nita utautairi je ?",
                "-Eh ee wajoli mimi ndimi mukristu mwana huu ninaye nitamutairi je."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-38e929c9",
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "( Tahiri mwana ) Eh ee wajoli sikilizeni \"2x jambo lilifanya Sipora alipo elekea nyumbani mwa kulala kuwageni jehova alitaka kumuwa Sipora kachukua jiwe katahiri mwana ngovi ikamwangukia Musa miguuni \" Ewe tukuza mungu wa uzima akilini mwako ewe chunga hekima kwake mungu wa uzima tumufanie uduma . \"2x"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-764d2d2c",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "2",
              "lines": [
                "–Kutahiri ni alama ya agano letu na bwana kama alivio fanya jehova na babu zetu lbrahimu kwa kutahiriwa kila mutu miongoni mwetu sharti apate kutahiriwa , ata akinunuliwa kwa feza sharti apate kutahiriwa, ( kila mume miongoni mwetu , na kila muke miongoni mwetu sharti apate kutahiriwa ."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-cc833103",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "3",
              "lines": [
                "-Ilipotimia siku , siku iyo yanane ya kumutahiri yesu wakenda naye hekaluni kwa kumutahiri Simoni kamuchukuwa mikononi akamwimidi mufalme ana akashukuru jehova katabiri huhru utaokuja katika kristo."
